---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Learn more about Magnus Oxenwaldt" />
	</head>
	<body class="bg-gray-50">
		<Header />
		<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
			<h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">About Me</h1>

			<div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
				<p class="text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-8">
					Hi, I'm Magnus Oxenwaldt - an AI & Digital Transformation Leader with over two decades
					of experience helping organizations navigate the complexities of technological change.
				</p>

				<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Professional Journey</h2>
				<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
					Currently serving as Principal Business Consultant at Columbus Global, I work at the
					intersection of artificial intelligence, enterprise architecture, and business transformation.
					My role involves designing solutions, organizing business structures, and assisting companies
					to embrace the digital world.
				</p>

				<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
					Based in Oslo, Norway, but with a Swedish background, I've had the privilege of working
					internationally and gaining diverse perspectives on how technology transforms businesses
					across different markets and cultures.
				</p>

				<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Areas of Expertise</h2>
				<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
					<div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">🤖 Artificial Intelligence</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-600">
							AI-driven solutions and integration strategies for enterprise applications,
							with focus on practical implementation and business value.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">🚀 Digital Transformation</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-600">
							Leading enterprise-wide transformation initiatives, change management,
							and helping organizations adapt to the digital age.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">🏗️ Enterprise Architecture</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-600">
							Designing scalable, sustainable solutions with ERP systems, customer
							engagement platforms, and integrated business applications.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">💼 Business Strategy</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-600">
							Combining technology, economics, and marketing expertise to drive
							strategic business outcomes.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Education & Background</h2>
				<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
					I hold a diversified academic background spanning technology, economics, and marketing,
					including a DIHM Diploma in Marketing and Economics from IHM Business School. This
					multidisciplinary foundation allows me to bridge the gap between technical solutions
					and business value.
				</p>

				<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Future Bytes Podcast</h2>
				<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
					I'm passionate about sharing knowledge and exploring the future of AI in business.
					That's why I host the <strong>Future Bytes podcast</strong>, where we discuss AI's
					real impact on business, practical implementation strategies, and how organizations
					can harness artificial intelligence to enhance efficiency and foster innovation.
				</p>
				<div class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-600 p-6 my-8">
					<p class="text-blue-900 font-semibold mb-2">Listen to Future Bytes</p>
					<p class="text-blue-800 mb-4">
						Exploring AI's positive impact on business, one byte at a time.
					</p>
					<a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/2dUyQaG5wFvCPBkB2ErHKe"
					   target="_blank"
					   rel="noopener noreferrer"
					   class="inline-block bg-green-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-green-700 transition">
						Listen on Spotify
					</a>
				</div>

				<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Upcoming Book</h2>
				<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
					I'm currently working on a book that will distill years of experience and insights
					in AI and digital transformation. Stay tuned for updates!
				</p>

				<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Let's Connect</h2>
				<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
					I'm always available for side collaborations and talks worldwide. Whether you're
					interested in discussing digital transformation, AI implementation, enterprise
					architecture, or simply want to exchange ideas about the latest technologies,
					I'd love to hear from you.
				</p>

				<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-8">
					<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/magnusoxenwaldt/"
					   target="_blank"
					   rel="noopener noreferrer"
					   class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition">
						Connect on LinkedIn
					</a>
					<a href="/blog"
					   class="inline-block border-2 border-blue-600 text-blue-600 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-50 transition">
						Read My Blog
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
